 r'Use algebra and the rules of limits to evaluate the following limits:'+'\n'+r'(a) \(\lim_{x\to4}\frac{-6}{(x-4)^2}\)'+'\n'+r'(b) \(\lim_{x\to0}\frac{\frac{1}{x+3}-\frac{1}{3}}{x}\)'+'\n'+r'(c) \(\lim_{x\to5}\frac{\sqrt{x}-\sqrt{5}}{x-5}\)',
